-# Webhook Delivery
+# Webhook delivery
 
-## Introduction
+We POST a JSON body to your endpoint when a subscribed event occurs. Each delivery carries an HMAC-SHA256 signature. A delivery is attempted up to 6 times.
 
-Our webhook system is a powerful and flexible way to receive real-time notifications about events in your account. In this guide, we'll walk through everything you need to know to build a robust receiver.
+Delivery is at-least-once. Your receiver must be idempotent: the same event ID can arrive more than once.
 
-## Overview
+## Request
 
-Webhooks are delivered as HTTP POST requests with a JSON body. Each delivery is cryptographically signed so that you can verify it genuinely came from us. Deliveries are retried on failure, and it's important to note that our delivery guarantee is *at-least-once* — meaning your receiver must be idempotent.
+```
+POST https://your-endpoint.example.com/hooks
+Content-Type: application/json
+User-Agent: Acme-Webhooks/1
+X-Acme-Event-Id: evt_01HQ8ZP4TXKM9N2VJ0BRWY7C3D
+X-Acme-Event-Type: invoice.paid
+X-Acme-Delivery-Id: dlv_01HQ8ZP5B6QN4RJ8XKD2WMFA7Y
+X-Acme-Attempt: 1
+X-Acme-Timestamp: 1769817600
+X-Acme-Signature: v1=6f3a1c9d84e0b27f5a1d3c8e9b04f76213ad5c8e9f0b1a2c3d4e5f60718293a4
+```
 
-## Request Format
+```json
+{
+  "id": "evt_01HQ8ZP4TXKM9N2VJ0BRWY7C3D",
+  "type": "invoice.paid",
+  "created_at": "2026-07-30T12:00:00Z",
+  "api_version": "2026-05-01",
